    <h1>16 Days Silk Road & Yunnan Tour</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Dunhuang &#8594; Turpan &#8594; Kashgar &#8594; Kunming &#8594; Dali &#8594; Lijiang &#8594; Shangri-La</div>
